  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The ESP Guardian Shield significantly improves the performance of ESP’s in high GOR / GLR horizontal wells. With OSI’s DUAL-FLOW Completion System technology, the inadequacies of traditional “dip tube” type assemblies are eliminated while optimizing operational effectiveness.",
   "box": {
    "x": 596,
    "y": 232,
    "w": 605,
    "h": 104
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The Guardian Shield includes an encapsulating shroud around the ESP pump motor that prevents overheating due to gas interference.",
   "box": {
    "x": 596,
    "y": 362,
    "w": 605,
    "h": 52
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "Guardian Shield provides multi-stage separation of gas and solids while ensuring uncompromised flow area versus standard dip tube tools.",
